     intended for use for material in which creators hold
     copyright and certain other rights specified in the public
     license. Public licenses are irrevocable. Creators should
     review our licenses carefully before selecting a license to
     apply to any material they wish to make available under the
     terms of a public license. Creators should also consider all
     uses of the material they wish to make available, and ensure
     that the license they select permits those uses.

     Considerations for the public: By using one of our public
     licenses, a licensor grants the public permission to use the
     licensed material under specified terms and conditions. If
     the licensor's permission is not necessary for any particular
     use--for example, because of any copyright exception or
